225</span><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubtermProp}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubtermProp}\\)</span>、替换和单孔上下文分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4aa3e02d8da9096c\" href=\"?note=4aa3e02d8da9096c\" title=\"56-df-subterm-property\">56-df-subterm-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fbc74eb888873878\" href=\"?note=fbc74eb888873878\" title=\"56-df-context\">56-df-context</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(T,Q)\\land\\mathrm{SubtermProp}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow s\\sigma\\;Q\\;t\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow C[s]\\;Q\\;C[t]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(T,Q)\\land\\mathrm{SubtermProp}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow s\\sigma\\;Q\\;t\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow C[s]\\;Q\\;C[t]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.3.14 的 simplification order，采用等价的全真子项条件。定义不直接要求良基；有限签名时 Proposition 6.3.15 给出良基，故可用作 reduction order。无限签名不能无条件省去良基假设。RPO 还有子项性质，因而是 simplification order（Proposition 6.4.25），但它在无限签名上的良基性仍来自良基 precedence。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.3.14; 6.4.25，印刷页 204; 221。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-subterm-property","status":"resolved","id":"4aa3e02d8da9096c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-context","status":"resolved","id":"fbc74eb888873878","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce