(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow s\\sigma\\;Q\\;t\\sigma)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\n(sQt\\Rightarrow C[s]\\;Q\\;C[t]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1822,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-simplification-order.md]]"},{"id":"ac167a6d94ee8495","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于 ZFC。设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$|F|<\\aleph_0$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$Q\\subseteq T^2$ 且 $\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)$，见 [[56-df-simplification-order]]。变量集 $V$ 可数无限。$\\mathrm{WF}$、$\\mathrm{RedOrd}$ 取该定义及 [[56-df-well-founded]] 的接口；证明所需的有限变量片段嵌入结论为 [[56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["4aa3e02d8da9096c","ea6d0d000271b1cf","6aa7f56f36c897f4","fbc74eb888873878"]}